msgstr "Pick a kingdom and set out on a 20-battle conquest. A boss waits every 5th battle."

#: scripts/ui/tips.gd
msgid "Savaşları ordun kendi yapar; senin işin orduyu kurmak ve büyütmek."
msgstr "Your army fights on its own; your job is to build it and make it grow."

#: scripts/ui/tips.gd
msgid "Kilitli krallıklar, koşu içinde boss'larını yenip fethi tamamlayınca açılır."
msgstr "Locked kingdoms open when you beat their boss during a run and finish the conquest."

